          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TimeSink 靠它看到最前面的应用和窗口标题。关闭期间不会记录任何时间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TimeSink uses this permission to read the frontmost app and window title. No time is recorded while it is off."
